      "x": 2799.95,
      "y": 552,
      "width": 490.09999999999997,
      "height": 81.25,
      "text": "The household, the doorbell, the merchants' agents and the\nproactive channel are all stand-ins. The MCP server, the OAuth\nflow, the ledger, the evidence reasoning and the negotiation\nprotocol are real and tested. None of it has run against the real\nAlexa+ client: Alexa+ for Builders is partner-gated.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The household, the doorbell, the merchants' agents and the\nproactive channel are all stand-ins. The MCP server, the OAuth\nflow, the ledger, the evidence reasoning and the negotiation\nprotocol are real and tested. None of it has run against the real\nAlexa+ client: Alexa+ for Builders is partner-gated.",
