      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2725.78,
      "y": 1648.25,
      "width": 648.4399999999999,
      "height": 48.75,
      "text": "In the demo, prm_010 was watched for 20% of its window against a 0.70 gate. It reads\n\"not enough to claim\", and Owed says so out loud rather than guessing. A refusal is an\noutcome here, not an error.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In the demo, prm_010 was watched for 20% of its window against a 0.70 gate. It reads\n\"not enough to claim\", and Owed says so out loud rather than guessing. A refusal is an\noutcome here, not an error.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
