      "x": 253.32000000000005,
      "y": 2191.75,
      "width": 633.3599999999999,
      "height": 113.75,
      "text": "event_id · household_id · kind · occurred_at · subject · spoken · resource_uri?\n\nexpires_at   after this, say nothing. Being told on Friday about a parcel that\n             failed on Sunday is worse than silence.\nurgency      only the add-on knows whether money is about to stop being recoverable.\noffer        the utterance and tool to answer with. Without it an announcement is a\n             dead end — you hear something is wrong and must work out how to fix it.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "event_id · household_id · kind · occurred_at · subject · spoken · resource_uri?\n\nexpires_at   after this, say nothing. Being told on Friday about a parcel that\n             failed on Sunday is worse than silence.\nurgency      only the add-on knows whether money is about to stop being recoverable.\noffer        the utterance and tool to answer with. Without it an announcement is a\n             dead end — you hear something is wrong and must work out how to fix it.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
