      "x": 2733.32,
      "y": 2092.125,
      "width": 633.3599999999999,
      "height": 65,
      "text": "Open at the ceiling. Counter at the reservation, citing the clause — never a number\nof our own invention. Accept anything at or above the published figure.\nAt the round cap of 3, take whatever is standing rather than walk away on principle:\na household is better off with five dollars than with a point well made.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Open at the ceiling. Counter at the reservation, citing the clause — never a number\nof our own invention. Accept anything at or above the published figure.\nAt the round cap of 3, take whatever is standing rather than walk away on principle:\na household is better off with five dollars than with a point well made.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
