      "x": 1531.02,
      "y": 3270.25,
      "width": 557.9599999999999,
      "height": 48.75,
      "text": "written down first:  ≥ 60% of owed, ≥ 1.5× the baseline, median ≤ 2 rounds\nNOT MET — 33.9% of owed at 1.10×, over 1,620 negotiations on 270 policies\nmet on the rounds criterion · 44.1% at 1.43× once it learns per merchant",
      "fontSize": 13,
