      "y": 3552.375,
      "width": 633.3599999999999,
      "height": 32.5,
      "text": "120 + 40 messages · 60 evidence timelines · 270 merchant policies × 6 breach kinds\nA test pins each committed corpus to its generator, so it cannot be quietly widened.",
